{"id":"f36bc28426b1a7dc","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-realizability-connectives.md","title":"实现性联结词和量词","display":"df-realizability-connectives — 实现性联结词和量词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-realizability-connectives","display":"df-realizability-connectives — 实现性联结词和量词","depends_on":["[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]","[[16-df-pca]]","[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]","[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]","[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]"],"source":"Example 5.3.4, pp. 333–334 (PDF 353–354)","revision_date":"2026-10-20","aliases":["16-df-realizability-connectives"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-realizability-connectives"},{"key":"display","html":"df-realizability-connectives — 实现性联结词和量词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e315868bd6a1509\" href=\"?note=2e315868bd6a1509\" title=\"16-df-realizability-fibration\">16-df-realizability-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5726b47e65d282e\" href=\"?note=d5726b47e65d282e\" title=\"16-df-pca\">16-df-pca</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eeefa02192bbb359\" href=\"?note=eeefa02192bbb359\" title=\"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Example 5.3.4, pp. 333–334 (PDF 353–354)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-realizability-connectives</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_A\">\\(r_A\\)</span> 及其同一个 PCA <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,\\cdot)\">\\((A,\\cdot)\\)</span>、宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e315868bd6a1509\" href=\"?note=2e315868bd6a1509\" title=\"16-df-realizability-fibration\">16-df-realizability-fibration</a>。固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5726b47e65d282e\" href=\"?note=d5726b47e65d282e\" title=\"16-df-pca\">16-df-pca</a> 构造分支的同一见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,S\">\\(K,S\\)</span>、由其定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>、配对和投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\subseteq A\">\\(U,V\\subseteq A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(L,M\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:L\\to M\">\\(u:L\\to M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\varphi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>。等式量词公式另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi:L\\times M\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\varphi:L\\times M\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in L\">\\(i\\in L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,j&#39;\\in M\">\\(j,j&#39;\\in M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a=b]\">\\([a=b]\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 可为任意同一指标集合中的元素。</li>\n<li>空指标交集约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a=b]\">\\([a=b]\\)</span> 是下文定义的集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle a,b\\rangle_A\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\langle a,b\\rangle_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,I\">\\(K,I\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5726b47e65d282e\" href=\"?note=d5726b47e65d282e\" title=\"16-df-pca\">16-df-pca</a> 的构造；所有集合值等式仅作用于所声明PCA。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\wedge_L\\psi,\\varphi\\vee_L\\psi,\\varphi\\Rightarrow_L\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\wedge_L\\psi,\\varphi\\vee_L\\psi,\\varphi\\Rightarrow_L\\psi\\)</span> 为本页定义的逐点谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BC}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitTripos}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitTripos}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"66d3058a6ae62dc5\" href=\"?note=66d3058a6ae62dc5\" title=\"16-df-first-order-fibration\">16-df-first-order-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"86e53aa076639692\" href=\"?note=86e53aa076639692\" title=\"16-df-beck-chevalley\">16-df-beck-chevalley</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"eeefa02192bbb359\" href=\"?note=eeefa02192bbb359\" title=\"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</a>。分裂取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_A\">\\(\\kappa_A\\)</span>，泛对象取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span>；量词的对象作用采用下式，箭头作用取相应预序 Hom 中的唯一箭头。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[a=b]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A&amp;a=b,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;a\\ne b.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[a=b]\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}A&amp;a=b,\\\\\\varnothing&amp;a\\ne b.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realizability\\text{-}connectives}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\bot&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nU\\wedge V&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\mid a\\in U,b\\in V\\},&amp;\nU\\vee V&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle K,a\\rangle\\mid a\\in U\\}\\cup\\{\\langle KI,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in V\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realizability\\text{-}connectives}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\top&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\bot&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\nU\\wedge V&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\mid a\\in U,b\\in V\\},&amp;\nU\\vee V&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle K,a\\rangle\\mid a\\in U\\}\\cup\\{\\langle KI,b\\rangle\\mid b\\in V\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Sigma_u\\varphi)(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in L}\\bigl([ui=j]\\wedge\\varphi(i)\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\Pi_u\\varphi)(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{i\\in L}\\bigl([ui=j]\\Rightarrow\\varphi(i)\\bigr)\n\\qquad(u:L\\to M),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{L,M}(\\varphi)((i,j),j&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq[j=j&#39;]\\wedge\\varphi(i,j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\Sigma_u\\varphi)(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in L}\\bigl([ui=j]\\wedge\\varphi(i)\\bigr),\\\\\n(\\Pi_u\\varphi)(j)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{i\\in L}\\bigl([ui=j]\\Rightarrow\\varphi(i)\\bigr)\n\\qquad(u:L\\to M),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Eq}_{L,M}(\\varphi)((i,j),j&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq[j=j&#39;]\\wedge\\varphi(i,j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\top_L(i)&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\bot_L(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n(\\varphi\\star_L\\psi)(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi(i)\\star\\psi(i)\n\\quad(\\star\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFib}(r_A)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BC}(r_A)\\land\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(r_A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\top_L(i)&amp;\\coloneqq A,&amp;\\bot_L(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n(\\varphi\\star_L\\psi)(i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi(i)\\star\\psi(i)\n\\quad(\\star\\in\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\Rightarrow\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFib}(r_A)&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BC}(r_A)\\land\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(r_A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>联结词按每个指标点定义；蕴涵 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\Rightarrow V\">\\(U\\Rightarrow V\\)</span> 已在上游展开。上式中的配对不能换成直接集合交，否则会错误地要求两个证明用同一代码。</li>\n<li>量词伴随通过一个固定实现元的编码、解码验证，换基是对指标的重排。公式保留了书中相等测试与蕴涵，尤其避免在空原像上把全称量词误写成空集。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Example 5.3.4, pp. 333–334 (PDF 353–354)。</li>\n<li>最后一式把这些构造接到本书实际的分裂 tripos 接口。合取的两投影、配对和组合实现元给出纤维积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,KI\">\\(K,KI\\)</span> 的分支选择给出余积；组合抽象给出蕴涵的伴随。量词式的编码和解码给出左右伴随，沿集合拉回重排索引给出 BC；重索引严格保持逐点运算，沿积投影和参数对角的换基对象式也逐点相等。因纤维为预序，相应比较箭头即为恒等。结合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_A\">\\(\\kappa_A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A\">\\(G_A\\)</span>，这些是分裂高阶结构的见证。此处没有断言普通 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_{r_A}(G_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_{r_A}(G_A)\\)</span>，也不把可实现等价的不同谓词强行认作同一函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-realizability-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"2e315868bd6a1509","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]","embed":false},{"targe